      "summary": {
        "@type": "Summary",
        "rdfs:label": "\"Bestselling author Gary Zimak has learned the peace that comes from an intimate relationship with Jesus Christ, and he has spent more than a decade helping others move from fear to faith through his speaking and writing ministry. In this treasury, Zimak targets common ways of suffering and discouragement and offers 120 chapters of inspiration, wisdom, and first-person prayers\"-- Provided by publisher."
