        "@type": "Summary",
        "rdfs:label": "\"The Las Vegas Aces won back-to-back WNBA championships in 2022 and 2023. They were the first repeat champions in more than 20 years. Discover how the Aces made it to the top of the WNBA\"-- Provided by publisher."
