      },
      "summary": {
        "@type": "Summary",
        "rdfs:label": "\"Austin-Healey. The combination of those two words evokes many memories for automotive enthusiasts. Some are fond memories and some tales of woe. However, anyone who has seen, owned, or lusted for an Austin-Healey remembers its classic swoopy shape and distinctive sound! The combined volumes of Austin-Healey Milestones are a compilation of Healey history with discussion of the joys and challenges of buying, owning, touring, and racing Austin- Healeys. Numerous articles go in-depth into restoration issues, commentary, road tests, facts and figures, news releases, and personalities. Vintage classified and magazine ads, stories, and plentiful photos of Healeys in many different scenarios give a fascinating insight into the beloved automobile over decades of production. Divided into chronological sections, Austin-Healey Milestones begins with the Healey family and details the first Healey through the last, along with a present-day discussion. Gone but not forgotten, the Austin-Healey has touched the hearts of thousands of folks-from everyday drivers to well-known celebrities. Hours of reading await you to help clarify its unique place in automotive history\"-- Provided by publisher."
      },
      "tableOfContents": {
        "@type": "TableOfContents",
        "rdfs:label": "v. 1. A -- v. 2. H"
      },
      "title": {
        "@type": "Title",
        "mainTitle": "Austin-Healey milestones"
      },
      "http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf": {
        "@id": "http://id.loc.gov/resources/works"
      }
    },
